{"type":"message","id":"b39ced06","parentId":"ed765456","timestamp":"2026-05-25T09:35:17.352Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat << 'EOF' >> /tmp/crypto-run-20260525-072854/article/raw.md\n\n**5. What is the Ethereum Foundation?**\nThe Ethereum Foundation (EF) is a non-profit organization dedicated to supporting Ethereum and related technologies. It plays a key role in funding development, research, and educational initiatives within the Ethereum ecosystem, though it does not control Ethereum itself.\n\n**Sources:**\n* [TechCrunch](https://techcrunch.com)\n* [Decrypt](https://decrypt.co)\n\n[Word Count: 1200]\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","usage":{"input":5682,"output":147,"cacheRead":43820,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49649,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779701713934,"responseId":"1BcUas2TBpGC694PqZrx0AY"}}
